# Outreach strategy and email drafts. Not secret, but there is no reason
# for the people being written to to read the plan first.
outreach/

# Russian working notes and the old project plan.
ЧТО_ДЕЛАТЬ.md

# Project guide and call preparation. Same reason as HANDOFF.md: it names a
# person, discusses a specific conversation, and repeats admission details.
tutorial.md
interview.md

